00:09:52.470 --> 00:09:53.970
- Should people eat fast food?

00:09:55.020 --> 00:09:55.853
- No.

00:09:55.853 --> 00:09:57.660
- It certainly needs to be very restricted

00:09:57.660 --> 00:10:00.270
and balanced with overall a healthy diet.

00:10:00.270 --> 00:10:01.401
- We're not as doctors

00:10:01.401 --> 00:10:04.020
parents to tell people what to do.

00:10:04.020 --> 00:10:05.370
We can tell them that the risks

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:07.410
of eating these unhealthy foods often

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:09.210
is gonna put them at serious risk.

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:11.894
But at the same reality, we
also have to be pragmatic.

00:10:11.894 --> 00:10:14.128
We're aware of so many things

00:10:14.128 --> 00:10:16.650
that put a risk into our patients' lives

00:10:16.650 --> 00:10:19.920
that we know we can't control everything.

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:21.450
So trying to be perfect

00:10:21.450 --> 00:10:23.850
actually usually yields to worse outcomes

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:26.130
'cause it creates problems
we weren't expecting

00:10:26.130 --> 00:10:28.440
or even destroys the initial goal

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:30.120
after a while 'cause it's unsustainable.

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:33.150
So eating fast foods generally unhealthy,

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:36.360
eating it for 30 days on
its own is a definite no-no.

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:39.150
- [Narrator] I consumed 30
pounds of sugar from their food.

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:41.370
