00:10:53.730 --> 00:10:55.731
is going to shift, it's up to you.

00:10:55.731 --> 00:10:58.708
But if you decide to keep
eating this way, go ahead.

00:10:58.708 --> 00:11:01.606
Over time, you may find yourself
getting as sick as I did.

00:11:01.606 --> 00:11:05.370
And you may wind up here or here.

00:11:05.370 --> 00:11:08.760
I guess the big question is
who do you wanna see go first?

